
 History file for the ProdDecayFiles package.
 --------------------------------------------

 Please enter a short description of any _changes_ made to files
in this package.

Jul 23 2004 Clare Brown (clareb@slac.stanford.edu)
Added decay files (one side B->Xs gamma, other side Breco cocktail for 
B0/+ mesons)
BB_BrecoCocktail_XsudgammaExp465_JetSet02.dec
BB_BrecoCocktail_XsudgammaExp480_JetSet02.dec
BB_BrecoCocktail_XsudgammaExp495_JetSet02.dec

V00-05-74 Jul 05, 2004 Lockman
  Corrected a typo in TurtleRead.tcl

V00-05-73 Jul 05, 2004 Lockman
  Added TurtleRead.tcl to use with GfiTurtleRead generator

Mar 18 2004 narsky
  Added decay files for B->D ppbar n(pi), n=0,1,2, both charged and neutral
  B modes.
B+B-_D+ppbar_K2pi.dec
B+B-_D+ppbarpi+pi-_K2pi.dec
B+B-_D-ppbar2pi+_K2pi.dec
B+B-_D0barppbarpi_Kpi.dec
B+B-_D0ppbarpi_Kpi.dec
B0B0bar_D0ppbar2pi_Kpi.dec
B0B0bar_D0ppbar_Kpi.dec

Feb 3, 2004, Abi Soffer (abi@slac.stanford.edu), version abi-3feb04
bug fix in B0B0bar_Dstar-l+nu_cpv.dec
(VSS_BMIX changed to VSS, which is what is needed for use with the
*NONCPEIGEN* models.  Also changed "Decay D*" -> "Decay myD*")

January 28, 2004 John Back (jback@slac.stanford.edu)
 Added the decay files B+B-_rho1450pi.dec and
B+B-_rho1700pi.dec for the decays B+ -> rho(1450)0 pi+
and B+ -> rho(1700)0 pi+, respectively, where
rho(1450)0 and rho(1700)0 both decay to pi+pi-.
Also corrected the decay within B+B-_Chi0pi.dec
(B+ -> chi_c0 pi+, chi_c0 -> pi+ pi- + C.C.)

January 21, 2004 John Back (jback@slac.stanford.edu)
 Added the decay file B+B-_f0pi_f0topipi.dec for the
decay B+ -> f0 pi+, f0 -> pi+pi-, using new
pole mass and width values for the f0 (see hep-ex/0007027).

