23-Oct-2002 John Back (jback@slac.stanford.edu)
- Added 6 lepton violating processes, using phase-space
  with PHOTOS:
  B+ -> e+ e+ pi-   (B+B-_e+e+pi-_PHSP.dec)
  B+ -> e+ e+ K-    (B+B-_e+e+K-_PHSP.dec)
  B+ -> mu+ mu+ pi- (B+B-_mu+mu+pi-_PHSP.dec)
  B+ -> mu+ mu+ K-  (B+B-_mu+mu+K-_PHSP.dec)
  B+ -> e+ mu+ pi-  (B+B-_e+mu+pi-_PHSP.dec)
  B+ -> e+ mu+ K-   (B+B-_e+mu+K-_PHSP.dec)

