30 March 2001 Andrei Gritsan (gritsan@slac.stanford.edu)
   Added the following (non)-resonant charmless decays
   with 4 tracks in the final state:

B+B-_phiK+pi0.dec               % B+  -> phi K+ pi0
B+B-_phiKSpi+.dec               % B+  -> phi KS pi+
B0B0bar_phiK+pi-.dec            % B0  -> phi K+ pi-
B0B0bar_phiKSpi0.dec            % B0  -> phi KS pi0
B+B-_K+K-Kstar_K+pi0.dec        % B+  -> K+ K- K*+ (K+pi0)
B+B-_K+K-Kstar_KSpi+.dec        % B+  -> K+ K- K*+ (KSpi+)
B+B-_K+K+Kstar_K-pi0.dec        % B+  -> K+ K+ K*- (K-pi0)
B+B-_K+K+Kstar_KSpi-.dec        % B+  -> K+ K+ K*- (KSpi-)
B0B0bar_K+K-Kstar_K+pi-.dec     % B0  -> K+ K- K*0 (K+pi-)
B0B0bar_K+K-Kstar_KSpi0.dec     % B0  -> K+ K- K*0 (KSpi0)
B+B-_rho0K+pi0.dec              % B+  -> rho0 K+ pi0
B+B-_rho0pi+pi0.dec             % B+  -> rho0 pi+ pi0
B+B-_rho0KSpi+.dec              % B+  -> rho0 KS pi+
B0B0bar_rho0K+pi-.dec           % B0  -> rho0 K+ pi-
B0B0bar_rho0pi+pi-.dec          % B0  -> rho0 pi+ pi-
B+B-_rho+K+pi-.dec              % B+  -> rho+ K+ pi-
B+B-_rho+pi+pi-.dec             % B+  -> rho+ pi+ pi-
B0B0bar_rho-K+pi0.dec           % B0  -> rho- K+ pi0
B0B0bar_rho-pi+pi0.dec          % B0  -> rho- pi+ pi0
B0B0bar_rho-KSpi+.dec           % B0  -> rho- KS pi+ 
B+B-_pi+pi-Kstar_K+pi0.dec      % B+  -> pi+ pi- K*+ (K+pi0)
B+B-_pi+pi-Kstar_KSpi+.dec      % B+  -> pi+ pi- K*+ (KSpi+)
B0B0bar_pi+pi-Kstar_K+pi-.dec   % B0  -> pi+ pi- K*0 (K+pi-)
